            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Fraud loss prevention — simulated business impact\n\nWhat the model would be **worth** if it were used to block or review suspicious transactions, swept across every decision threshold from 0.05 to 0.95.\n\n> ⚠️ **The savings shown are simulated estimates based on historical transaction labels, model predictions, and configurable business assumptions. They should not be interpreted as guaranteed real-world savings without production validation.**\n\nRead the assumptions tile *before* the number beside it: three of the four inputs to every figure on this page are assumed, not measured."
              ]
            }
