          "widget": {
            "name": "impact_method",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "### How a saving is computed\n`gross = detected_fraud_amount × prevention_rate` · `review_cost = flagged × cost_per_review` · `friction = false_positives × customer_friction_cost` · **`net = gross − review_cost − friction`**\n\nReviews are charged on false positives too — the queue cannot tell them apart until they are worked. Not modelled at all: recovery on missed fraud, the time-value of a blocked payment, churn, and the cost of running the platform. Treating those as zero is more honest than inventing a number for them."
              ]
            }
